---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout {...{"title": "SEEK Adventure Middle School Camp | Hide and Seek Day Camp", "description": "One week at Hickory Flat where middle schoolers connect with their peers and their counselors as they grow in their walk with the Lord.", "path": "/explore-camp/seek-adventure/", "banner": {"img": "/img/seek-header.webp", "alt": "Large group of campers in matching purple shirts", "eyebrow": "Finished 6th, 7th, and 8th grade", "title": "SEEK Adventure Middle School Camp", "intro": "One week at Hickory Flat where middle schoolers connect with their peers and their counselors as they grow in their walk with the Lord.", "h1": "title", "crumb": {"href": "/explore-camp/", "label": "Explore Camp"}}}}>
  <div class="sec" style="padding-bottom:0"><div class="wrap g4">
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">Grades</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em">Finished 6th to 8th</p></div>
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">Length</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em">One week in July</p></div>
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">Hours</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em">9 a.m. to 4 p.m.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">Cost</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em">$300</p></div>
  </div><p class="p wrap" style="margin-top:20px">No early drop off or post camp for this program. Hickory Flat only.</p></div>
  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap g2" style="gap:56px;align-items:center">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">What the week covers</p><h2 class="h2">A week built for the in between years</h2><p class="p">The curriculum focuses on God's plan for their lives and how to walk closer with Him through a transitional phase of life. Campers make Christian friends from their own community.</p><div class="row" style="margin-top:20px"><a href="https://www.ultracamp.com/clientlogin.aspx?idCamp=307&amp;campcode=hns&amp;lang=en-Us" data-ev="register_click" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="navy">Register</a></div></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px">
      <div class="ph" style="height:200px"><img src="/img/seek-01.webp" alt="Campers holding a painted banner"></div>
      <div class="ph" style="height:200px;margin-top:28px"><img src="/img/seek-02.webp" alt="Camper smiling and pointing at the camera"></div>
      <div class="ph" style="height:200px"><img src="/img/seek-03.webp" alt="Camper sitting on the grass smiling"></div>
      <div class="ph" style="height:200px;margin-top:28px"><img src="/img/seek-04.webp" alt="Campers lined up indoors"></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="tint" style="padding:88px clamp(20px,3vw,40px)"><div class="wrap g3">
    <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">Bigger activities</h3><p class="s">With only middle schoolers on campus, the ropes course and field games run at their level.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">More time in the woods</h3><p class="s">Longer hikes, longer rotations, and a later end to the day at 4 p.m.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">Friends from home</h3><p class="s">Campers meet Christian friends from their own schools and neighborhoods.</p></div>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
